100 PRINT "GFX-0161 AN INTERNAL PICTURE-DEF SHARES THE VARIABLES AND ARRAYS OF ITS PROGRAM-UNIT (13.5.4)"
110 DECLARE PICTURE P
120 LET A = 5
130 LET S$ = "ab"
